      "id": "riivolution-mini",
      "title": "Riivolution for Wii Mini",
      "kind": "app",
      "version": "v1.07",
      "group": "Mod loaders",
      "description": "A separate Riivolution build listed by Open Shop Channel for Wii Mini.",
      "requirements": "A homebrew-enabled Wii Mini, compatible USB storage, retail disc and a mod that explicitly supports its own Mini/USB data route.",
      "compatibility": "Wii Mini only for this listed package. A Mini-capable loader does not make Newer or CTGP SD-only packages compatible.",
      "setup": "Copy apps/riivolution-mini to the USB root and keep the supplied boot.elf and metadata together. Follow the chosen mod’s USB/XML paths. OSC flags NAND-writing capability; do not install a shortcut simply to test a patch.",
