      "id": "falling-leaf",
      "title": "Newer Falling Leaf",
      "kind": "mod",
      "version": "1.12",
      "group": "New Super Mario Bros. Wii",
      "description": "An autumn-themed Newer special featuring eight new levels.",
      "requirements": "New Super Mario Bros. Wii retail disc, SD card, and a compatible Riivolution setup. Keep this special separate from the full Newer installation.",
      "compatibility": "Wii / vWii SD route. Region and revision restrictions come from the included Riivolution XML; no Mini compatibility is inferred.",
      "setup": "Extract the supplied mod-data folder and riivolution directory to the SD root. Enable this special’s option in Riivolution with the correct disc inserted. Disable other NSMBW overhaul patches.",
